528
00:50:23.397 --> 00:50:24.817
That's important, isn't it?

529
00:50:24.897 --> 00:50:25.417
What?

530
00:50:25.497 --> 00:50:27.497
To be right, everybody else to be wrong.

531
00:50:27.577 --> 00:50:29.048
