596
00:55:38.737 --> 00:55:42.208
Mass hysteria. What do they
think we're imagining all this?

597
00:55:42.297 --> 00:55:44.157
...in all parts of the country.

598
00:55:44.237 --> 00:55:47.537
The wave of murder which is sweeping
the eastern third of the nation...

599
00:55:47.617 --> 00:55:52.737
