628
00:57:37.037 --> 00:57:38.861
There's a pump out by the shed.

629
00:57:39.037 --> 00:57:40.837
That's why I pulled in
here, but it's locked.

630
00:57:40.917 --> 00:57:43.517
...called this afternoon by the president.

631
