743
01:03:07.557 --> 01:03:10.417
We can toss the cocktails
from a window upstairs.

744
01:03:10.497 --> 01:03:12.797
In the meantime, a couple of us
can go out and try to get the gas...

745
01:03:12.877 --> 01:03:14.537
...and come back for
the rest of the people.

746
01:03:14.617 --> 01:03:16.757
But that'll leave a door open someplace.

747
01:03:16.837 --> 01:03:17.957
Yeah, that's right.

748
01:03:18.037 --> 01:03:19.417
It better be this door.

749
01:03:19.757 --> 01:03:21.137
closer to the truck.

750
01:03:21.997 --> 01:03:24.557
Before we involve the blitz and
supplies behind the cellar door,

751
01:03:24.637 --> 01:03:26.497
while they're gone, the rest
of you can hold up in there.

752
01:03:26.577 --> 01:03:28.377
I found some fruit jars in the cellar.

753
01:03:28.457 --> 01:03:32.398
And there's a key on here that's
labeled for the gas pump out back.

754
01:03:32.957 --> 01:03:34.937
I'm not really that used to the truck.

755
01:03:35.017 --> 01:03:36.417
I found it abandoned.

756
01:03:36.777 --> 01:03:38.757
I can handle the truck with no sweat.

757
01:03:38.837 --> 01:03:40.477
And kill living human beings...

758
01:03:40.557 --> 01:03:42.297
...heated on their flesh.

759
01:03:42.377 --> 01:03:43.277
You're it, then.

760
01:03:43.357 --> 01:03:44.737
You and I'll go.

761
