then we'll worry about getting
everybody into the truck.

769
01:04:13.457 --> 01:04:14.857
Now, let's move it.

770
01:04:16.977 --> 01:04:19.977
except to the rescue stations
which have been set up.

771
01:04:20.057 --> 01:04:24.477
Indications are that before this
emergency is over, we will need many,

772
01:04:24.557 --> 01:04:27.037
