790
01:05:23.297 --> 01:05:25.637
We've got to get to a rescue station.

791
01:05:25.877 --> 01:05:27.017
I don't know.

792
01:05:27.097 --> 01:05:28.857
Come on, honey, you're
starting to sound like Mr.

793
01:05:28.937 --> 01:05:31.877
Cooper now. But why do
you have to go out there?

794
01:05:31.957 --> 01:05:35.637
Look, I know how to handle that
