I know. I know all that.

800
01:05:52.337 --> 01:05:53.877
Hey, listen.

801
01:05:55.037 --> 01:05:57.257
Remember when we had the big flood?

802
01:05:57.557 --> 01:06:02.117
Remember how difficult it was for us to
