803
01:06:02.197 --> 01:06:04.957
Remember? Remember we
had to go to Willard then?

804
01:06:05.037 --> 01:06:07.217
This isn't a passing thing, honey.

805
01:06:07.857 --> 01:06:10.857
It's not like just a wind passing through.

806
01:06:11.117 --> 01:06:13.777
We've got to do something, and fast.

807
01:06:19.617 --> 01:06:22.617
I just don't want you to
go out there, that's all.

808
01:06:23.857 --> 01:06:25.357
Hey, Smiley.

809
01:06:26.397 --> 01:06:28.417
