yeah.

814
01:06:56.497 --> 01:06:58.257
We better get her downstairs.

815
01:06:58.597 --> 01:07:01.057
We have to go downstairs now, Barbara.

816
01:07:02.817 --> 01:07:03.937
She's right.

817
01:07:04.117 --> 01:07:08.197
You have to go downstairs now, just
for a little while, until we get back.

818
01:07:08.277 --> 01:07:10.097
Then we can all leave.

819
01:07:10.177 --> 01:07:11.997
Oh, I'd like to leave.

820
01:07:12.077 --> 01:07:13.077
Yes.

821
01:07:31.497 --> 01:07:33.117
Good luck.

822
01:07:33.197 --> 01:07:34.197
Yeah.

823
