Seems like it was pretty far away.

866
01:16:43.557 --> 01:16:45.697
It seems like we ran.

867
01:16:46.657 --> 01:16:49.237
Forget it. It's at least a mile.

868
01:16:49.397 --> 01:16:51.197
Johnny has the keys.

869
01:16:51.717 --> 01:16:55.257
You gonna carry that child a mile
