885
01:17:34.497 --> 01:17:36.917
Yeah, yeah, I know, but where is it?

886
01:17:49.657 --> 01:17:51.357
Good Lord.

887
01:18:00.977 --> 01:18:06.297
Being monitored closely by scientists
at all the radiation detection stations.

888
01:18:06.437 --> 01:18:11.197
At this hour, they report the level of
the mysterious radiation continues to

889
