894
01:18:31.917 --> 01:18:36.237
Our news cameras have just returned
from covering such a search-and-destroy

895
01:18:36.317 --> 01:18:37.817
operation against the ghouls.

896
01:18:37.897 --> 01:18:41.517
This one conducted by Sheriff
Conan McClellan in Butler County,

897
01:18:41.597 --> 01:18:42.537
Pennsylvania.

898
01:18:42.617 --> 01:18:44.735
So now let's go to that film report.

899
01:18:44.977 --> 01:18:49.957
All law enforcement agencies and the
military have been organized to search out and

900
01:18:50.037 --> 01:18:51.917
