936
01:20:25.517 --> 01:20:29.097
We know we'll be into it most of the
night, probably into the early morning.

937
01:20:29.177 --> 01:20:32.697
We're working our way toward Willard, and
we'll team up with the National Guard over

938
01:20:32.777 --> 01:20:34.937
