Get the cellar.

960
01:22:52.077 --> 01:22:54.457
Get the cellar now. Move!

961
01:23:20.837 --> 01:23:22.737
Oh!

962
01:23:57.397 --> 01:24:00.697
Come on.

963
01:24:38.037 --> 01:24:39.397
Karen?

964
01:24:39.617 --> 01:24:41.517
Karen?

965
