All right, Steve. Tell them
we're going to stay with it then.

997
01:31:10.917 --> 01:31:13.211
Everything appears to be under control.

998
01:32:16.377 --> 01:32:18.257
Somebody had a cook out here, Vince.

999
01:32:18.337 --> 01:32:20.237
Yeah, sure looks like it, cop.

1000
01:32:58.797 --> 01:33:00.737
Jesus, that one, get up here!

1001
01:33:02.197 --> 01:33:06.957
Nick, Tony, Steve, you want to get out
in that field and build me a bonfire?

1002
01:33:18.817 --> 01:33:21.837
You, drag that out of here
and throw it on the fire.

1003
01:33:21.917 --> 01:33:23.257
Nothing down here.

1004
01:33:24.957 --> 01:33:26.337
Let's go check out the house.

1005
01:33:26.417 --> 01:33:28.829
There's something there. I heard a noise.

1006
01:33:33.237 --> 01:33:34.657
All right, Vince. Hit him in the head.

1007
01:33:34.737 --> 01:33:36.090
Right between the eyes.

1008
01:33:39.497 --> 01:33:40.797
Good shot.

1009
01:33:40.917 --> 01:33:42.877
Okay, he's dead. Let's go get him.

1010
01:33:42.957 --> 01:33:44.839
That's another one for the fire.

1011
01:33:55.517 --> 01:33:56.757
Get out of here.

1012
01:33:56.837 --> 01:33:58.557
I'll take you to the water.

1013
01:33:58.857 --> 01:34:00.157
I'll be out.

1014
01:34:05.037 --> 01:34:07.497
All right, send the wagon through.

1015
01:34:07.717 --> 01:34:09.417
Come directly on it.

1016
01:34:10.057 --> 01:34:11.077
Right here, you're coming.

1017
01:34:11.157 --> 01:34:12.417
Put the air torch.

1018
01:34:15.717 --> 01:34:18.457
Keep those dogs back off of those things.

1019
01:34:26.897 --> 01:34:28.297
Come on, sir.

1020
01:34:29.217 --> 01:34:31.057
Come on, sir.

1021
01:34:31.377 --> 01:34:33.437
Come on. Go for it quickly.

1022
01:35:19.817 --> 01:35:22.597
Come in with the motorcycle, please.

1023
01:35:22.737 --> 01:35:24.457
Let's go, back there.

1024
01:35:25.517 --> 01:35:26.517
Help!

1025
01:35:27.337 --> 01:35:30.297
Hey, Randy, light these torches over here.

